1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
[stairwell timer switch click, 100 Hz ballast hum]

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Three in the morning.
[leather unrolling, clink of spring steel]

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
A locked door.
[paper rustle]

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[dry metal sliding into brass]

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
[metallic bind, low thrum]

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
No progress bars.
[gritty brass-on-steel friction]

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,500
Just brass, steel, and spring.
[crisp high click — 3.2 kHz]

8
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,500
[hollow double click — 1.1 kHz]

9
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,500
[slow reverse scrape, high set click]

10
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,500
When the light goes out — listen.
[timer switch clicks off — silence, then two crisp clicks in the dark]

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,000
[heavy low deadbolt clunk — 220 Hz]

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
[soft hinge creak, stairwell air]

13
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
LOCKWRIGHT — Available on Android · iOS
[single tap of a pick set down on wood]
